{"id":"57ea3ea286817df3","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-second-incompleteness.md","title":"Gödel's Second Incompleteness Theorem","display":"thm-second-incompleteness — Gödel's Second Incompleteness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-second-incompleteness","aliases":["92-thm-second-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-second-incompleteness — Gödel's Second Incompleteness Theorem","depends_on":["[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-lem-derivability-conditions]]","[[92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness]]","[[92-df-diagonalizable-system]]"],"source":"第 IX 章 pp. 108–110，Theorems 2–3（PDF 125–127）","source_status":"原书定理的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-second-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-second-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-second-incompleteness — Gödel's Second Incompleteness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5c268cc9a199d00a\" href=\"?note=5c268cc9a199d00a\" title=\"92-lem-derivability-conditions\">92-lem-derivability-conditions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1f22fd0f606ee7bd\" href=\"?note=1f22fd0f606ee7bd\" title=\"92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness\">92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cb62be5b9aab48d1\" href=\"?note=cb62be5b9aab48d1\" title=\"92-df-diagonalizable-system\">92-df-diagonalizable-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IX 章 pp. 108–110，Theorems 2–3（PDF 125–127）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书定理的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span> (internal consistency sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (external consistency predicate for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}second\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}second\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>：对象语言中的一致性句</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span>：元语言中的实际相容性</li>\n<li>Gödel第二不完备性定理：本书固定的、有效且具有足够算术强度的系统<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>若相容，就不能证明由其标准证明谓词形成的自身一致性句</li>\n<li>该结论依赖证明谓词的Hilbert--Bernays--Löb可导性条件；它不是“任意一致形式系统都不能证明某个同名句子”的断言</li>\n<li>标准证明可由形式化的不完备性论证或Löb定理得到，不能把所需内化步骤省略成未经说明的“直接推论”</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G=\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G=\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\\)</span>，与Gödel固定点密切相关</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S=G\">\\(\\mathcal S=G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=B_G\">\\(B=B_G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=\\bot_G\">\\(f=\\bot_G\\)</span> 实例化<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"1f22fd0f606ee7bd\" href=\"?note=1f22fd0f606ee7bd\" title=\"92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness\">92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness</a>。本地固定点构造给出 diagonalizable；所选证明公式明确满足 HBL，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\bot_G\">\\(\\neg\\bot_G\\)</span>。不可证结论只用这三项及一致性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span> 的标准真值解释还使用证明公式的语义正确性。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 IX 章 pp. 108–110，Theorems 2–3（PDF 125–127）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-derivability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"5c268cc9a199d00a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-lem-derivability-conditions]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"1f22fd0f606ee7bd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-diagonalizable-system","status":"resolved","id":"cb62be5b9aab48d1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-diagonalizable-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}_G$ (internal consistency sentence, see [[92-df-consistency-statement]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (external consistency predicate for $G$, see [[92-df-consistent]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"1f22fd0f606ee7bd","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"以 $\\mathcal S=G$、$B=B_G$、$f=\\bot_G$ 实例化[[92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness]]。本地固定点构造给出 diagonalizable；所选证明公式明确满足 HBL，$G$ 证明 $\\neg\\bot_G$。不可证结论只用这三项及一致性；$\\mathrm{Con}_G$ 的标准真值解释还使用证明公式的语义正确性。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}second\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_G=\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S=G","display":false},{"tex":"B=B_G","display":false},{"tex":"f=\\bot_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\bot_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false}],"bytes":2171,"backlinks":[{"id":"75be5f3bdd0be0c7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本地实例见[[92-df-provability-predicate]]、[[92-df-consistency-statement]]、[[92-thm-lob-theorem]]、[[92-thm-second-incompleteness]]。Löb 本身不需要相容性；第二不完备性用相容性排除矛盾句。"},{"id":"f6a3d5bf0214e6eb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"547330c19863e2e8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2e79b6767e33bac3","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d671aa63fca8d973","anchor":"re